+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+- Greenfield bootstrap, voyage 1. Runner proven: `npx cucumber-js --dry-run` executes (0 scenarios at bootstrap).
+- Storage key fixed as `todos-vanillajs` (vanilla JS, spec format `todos-[framework]`).
+- Verification tier: happy-dom, cheapest DOM tier; installed per package.json.
+- Toolchain slots left `none` pending user word: lint (biome present in node_modules but undeclared), coverage (c8 likewise), plank-inventory (jsdoc absent; plain-JS stack wants `jsdoc -X`).
+- assets/app-spec.md sections treated as out of scope for specs: directory-structure prose, README requirement, code-style rules, browser-compatibility matrix. Await user confirmation of exclusion per the Asset policy before QM dispatch.
